desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Use Defused Xmlrpc"
	title_zh: "Use Defused Xmlrpc"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-use-defused-xmlrpc"
	risk: "xxe"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Detected use of xmlrpc. xmlrpc is not inherently safe from vulnerabilities. Use defusedxml.xmlrpc instead.

### 风险类型
XML 外部实体注入（XXE）（xxe）

### 影响
解析不可信 XML 时允许外部实体，可能读取本地文件或发起 SSRF。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-776: Improper Restriction of Recursive Entity References in DTDs ('XML Entity Expansion')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
禁用外部实体和 DTD，使用安全的 XML 解析配置。

推荐修复：
Use defusedxml.xmlrpc instead.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.py": <<<POS
import xmlrpclib
POS
	"safefile://pos.py": <<<NEG
import defusedxmlrpc
NEG
)

${*.py}.pattern_regex(/(?:import\s+xmlrpclib)|(?:import\s+SimpleXMLRPCServer)|(?:import\s+xmlrpc)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Use Defused Xmlrpc",
	title_zh: "Use Defused Xmlrpc",
	message: "Use Defused Xmlrpc detected.",
}
